        "paragraphs": []
      },
      {
        "section": "SYSTEM_WIDE_CONSEQUENCE",
        "paragraphs": []
      },
      {
        "section": "SCIENCE_EXPLANATION",
        "paragraphs": [
          {
            "text": "And here is where science stops being certain. The governing physics: the geodynamo in Earth's liquid outer core generates a field that deflects the solar wind.",
            "claims": [
              "C3"
            ],
            "role": "evidence"
          }
